      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Oquawka_Illinois",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A 12‑foot limestone tombstone topped with a concrete elephant statue marks the burial of Norma Jean, an elephant struck by lightning in 1972.",
